<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>MHT CET Mock Test</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#f6f7fb;--card:#fff;--tx:#1b1f2a;--mu:#667085;--ac:#2f5bea;--ok:#12a150;--bad:#d92d20;--bd:#e3e6ee;--mk:#f79009;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#12141b;--card:#1b1e28;--tx:#e8eaf0;--mu:#98a2b3;--ac:#6b8cff;--bd:#2c3040}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
.w{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:12px}
h1{font-size:1.4rem;margin:.2rem 0}h2{font-size:1.1rem;margin:0 0 8px}
.mu{color:var(--mu);font-size:.9rem}
button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--bd);background:var(--card);color:var(--tx);padding:8px 14px}
button.p{background:var(--ac);border-color:var(--ac);color:#fff}
button:disabled{cursor:default;color:var(--tx);opacity:1}
.tab{font-weight:600}.tab.on{background:var(--ac);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ac)}
.pal .w{background:var(--bad);color:#fff;border-color:var(--bad)}
textarea{width:100%;height:130px;font:12px monospace;background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:8px;padding:8px}
.top{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:5;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:12px}
#t{font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}#t.low{color:var(--bad)}
.g{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 240px;gap:12px}
@media(max-width:720px){.g{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.opt{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:10px}
.opt.sel{border-color:var(--ac);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ac) 14%,transparent)}
.opt.ok{border-color:var(--ok);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ok) 15%,transparent)}
.opt.no{border-color:var(--bad);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bad) 15%,transparent)}
.pal{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,38px);gap:6px}
.pal button{padding:6px 0;width:38px}
.pal .a{background:var(--ok);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ok)}
.pal .m{background:var(--mk);color:#fff;border-color:var(--mk)}
.pal .c{outline:2px solid var(--ac)}
.row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
.big{font-size:2rem;font-weight:700}
.hide{display:none}
</style></head><body><div class="w">

<div id="s1">
 <h1>MHT CET Mock Test (PCM)</h1>
 <p class="mu">150 questions · 3 hours · Physics &amp; Chemistry 1 mark each, Maths 2 marks each · no negative marking</p>
 <div id="pg1"></div>
 <div class="card"><h2>Full random test</h2><p class="mu">150 questions in MHT CET pattern: 50 Physics, 50 Chemistry, 50 Maths. A fresh set is generated every attempt.</p><button class="p" id="rnd">Start random 150-question test</button></div>
 <div class="card"><h2>Or use your own questions</h2>
  <p class="mu">A few original sample questions are loaded. Paste your previous-year questions as JSON, or upload a .json file. Format: <code>{"s":"Physics|Chemistry|Maths","q":"question","o":["A","B","C","D"],"a":0,"e":"explanation"}</code> — <code>a</code> is the index (0–3) of the correct option.</p>
  <textarea id="ta"></textarea>
  <div class="row"><input type="file" id="f" accept=".json"><button class="p" id="go">Start with my own questions</button></div>
  <p class="mu" id="msg"></p>
 </div>
</div>

<div id="s2" class="hide">
 <div class="top"><div><b id="sub"></b> <span class="mu" id="cnt"></span></div><div id="t">3:00:00</div><button class="p" id="sb">Submit</button></div>
 <div class="row" id="tabs" style="margin:0 0 12px"></div>
 <div class="g">
  <div class="card"><div class="mu" id="mk"></div><h2 id="q" style="white-space:pre-wrap"></h2><div id="o"></div><div id="fb" class="hide"></div>
   <div class="row"><button id="pv">← Prev</button><button id="nx">Next →</button><button id="rv">Mark for review</button></div></div>
  <div class="card"><h2>Questions</h2><div class="pal" id="pal"></div>
   <button class="p" id="sb2" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px">Submit test</button>
   <p class="mu"><span style="color:var(--ok)">■</span> correct <span style="color:var(--bad)">■</span> wrong <span style="color:var(--mk)">■</span> marked</p></div>
 </div>
</div>

<div id="s3" class="hide">
 <div class="card"><h1>Result</h1><div class="big" id="sc"></div><div id="br" class="mu"></div>
  <div class="row"><button class="p" onclick="location.reload()">New attempt</button></div></div>
 <div id="an"></div>
 <div id="rev"></div>
</div>
</div>
